Rule 4 (input tensors must have the same data type)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 6 (the input tensors must have a real numeric data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 10 (all dimensions of the input tensors must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
