Rule 12 (the input tensor must have a data type that supports ordering)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) < 9
>>
Rule 13 (input tensor must be at least 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
